 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+- Copy drafts follow TensorFold #319 by [Arminova](https://github.com/Arminova), ported from 0.6.4 to v0.6.1
+  (patch `0012-flash-next-copy-first`): on one GPU a round first verifies a copy from the context, its window
+  growing from 16 to 64 rows while copies land whole. A reply that repeats its prompt word for word went from
+  153.8 to ~535 tok/s, a one-word rewrite from 141.4 to ~322 tok/s; prose, code and prefill within noise; the
+  replies are byte-identical. `TENSORFOLD_MTP_COPY` is gone: copies are on whenever MTP drafts are, on one GPU.
+  The startup estimate at the defaults goes from 85.39 to 85.81 GiB.
+
